"name": "Sphere Entertainment Co.",
"description": "Sphere Entertainment Co. engages in the provision of live entertainment and media services. It operates through the following segments: Sphere and MSG Networks. The Sphere segment engages in deriving revenues primarily from ticket sales and other ticket-related revenues, venue license fees from third-party promoters, sponsorships, signage and Exosphere advertising, suite licenses and food, beverage, and merchandise sales. The MSG Networks segment engages in deriving revenues principally from distribution fees, as well as from the sale of advertising. The company was founded in 2010 and is headquartered in New York, NY.",
